      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I had hoped to avoid these paths... The eastern way is through dwarvish territory and is shorter. I pray the dwarves will grant us safe passage, since the other path is through troll territory..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Not even in yer dreams, elf. These are dwarvish lands, and troubles we want no part of nip at yer heels. Get out and stay out!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Our troubles will be yours, too, whether either of us wills it or not. The orcs have come down from the north like a flood; if we squabble among ourselves they will feast on our discord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Bah. More smooth words and trickery, by my beard. We know yer kind... and who needs yer help anyway, weaklings? Leave now, or feel my axe! That same kiss of steel will greet all intruders. Anyone who sets foot on the eastern bank o’ this river will rue the day he was born!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I cannot see how trolls could be any less friendly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hmm... Perhaps the dwarves’ intransigence can serve our purpose. Onwards, and no matter what you do, do <i>not</i> step on the eastern bank of the river!"),
          },
          {
